"<h1 data-source-line="1-1">KaTeX auto-render from the CDN</h1>
<p data-source-line="3-3">Documents that bring their own KaTeX keep working offline because the URLs are rewritten to the bundled copy.</p>
<link data-source-line="5-7" rel="stylesheet" href="mdview://doc/__inlay/vendor/katex/katex.min.css" data-inlay-vendor="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.css">
