exports[`fixture snapshots > unicode-text.md [full] 1`] = `
"<h1 data-source-line="1-1">Unicode text</h1>
<h2 data-source-line="3-3">Vietnamese</h2>
<p data-source-line="5-5">Tiếng Việt có dấu: Hà Nội, Đà Nẵng, Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh. Chữ "ự", "ờ", "ẫ" dùng nhiều dấu kết hợp. Gõ Telex: <code>aa</code> → â, <code>dd</code> → đ, <code>ow</code> → ơ.</p>
<p data-source-line="7-7">Decomposed form (combining marks): Tiếng Việt — the next word uses real combining characters: Tiếng (U+0065 U+0302 U+0301 style).</p>
<h2 data-source-line="9-9">CJK</h2>
<p data-source-line="11-13">中文：这是一个 Markdown 编辑器，能完整渲染嵌入的 SVG 和 HTML。
日本語：これはマークダウンエディタです。全角スペース　と句読点、。
한국어: 마크다운 편집기입니다. 한글 입력 테스트.</p>
<h2 data-source-line="15-15">Emoji and astral-plane characters</h2>
<p data-source-line="17-18">Emoji: 🙂 🇻🇳 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 🧑🏽‍💻 — family and skin-tone sequences use ZWJ.
Astral: 𝔘𝔫𝔦𝔠𝔬𝔡𝔢 (mathematical fraktur), 😀 (U+1F600), 𠀋 (CJK Extension B).</p>
<h2 data-source-line="20-20">Mixed directions</h2>
<p data-source-line="22-22">العربية مع English inside, and עברית too.</p>
<table data-source-line="24-27"><thead><tr><th>Ngôn ngữ</th><th>例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Việt</td><td>Xin chào</td></tr><tr><td>日本</td><td>こんにちは</td></tr></tbody></table>"
`;

